|desc=
Fills the air around you with reactive currents of force.

If you have a gem or mindstar in your psionically wielded slot, this will do {{ctmd|10|40}} Physical damage to all who approach. 

All damage done by the aura will drain one point of energy per (9 + Talent Level) points of damage dealt.

If you have a conventional weapon in your psionically wielded slot, this will add {{ctmd|10|40}} Physical damage to its hits.

When deactivated, if you have at least 6.67 energy, a massive spike of kinetic energy is released as a range 6 beam, smashing targets for up to (10 * {{ctmd|10|40}}) physical damage and sending them flying.

Activating the aura takes no time but de-activating it does.

To turn off an aura without spiking it, deactivate it and target yourself.  The damage will improve with your Mindpower.
